/**
 * Computes the Three.js unit world direction vector (dX, dY, dZ) from a SUMO heading.
 *
 * @param {number} sumoAngleDeg - Heading in degrees [0, 360)
 * @returns {{x: number, y: number, z: number}} Three.js unit world direction vector
